      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "maemo a diphapo",
      "rationale": "Tšhupetšo ya sebopego: diphapo tše pedi, ye tee lehla-reng la leboa e lebelela borwa, ye nngwe lehlakoreng la bosea e lebelela leboa."
    }
